      "label": "Hygiene Stereotype Against Muslims",
      "description": "The meme targets individuals who follow Islamic dietary laws (halal), by mocking the concept of 'unclean' food through a vulgar comparison to goats, which are culturally associated with foul smell and uncleanliness. This implicitly equates religious dietary restrictions with animal-based degradation, appealing to an audience familiar with or sensitive to such stereotypes.",
